---
title: "SevaForge v3.0 — Deploy Flow Walk-Through (Self-Hosted OSS)"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  participant CLI as 🖥️ forgeflow CLI<br/>(L1 — Client)
  participant TRF as 🌐 Traefik + Keycloak<br/>(L2 — Ingress)
  participant MC as 🎯 MissionControl<br/>(L3 — Orchestration)
  participant RAG as 📚 RAGPipeline<br/>(L3 — RAG Context)
  participant PS as 🔍 ProjectScanner<br/>(L4 — Agent)
  participant DA as 🐳 DockerAgent<br/>(L4 — Agent)
  participant TA as 🏗️ TerraformAgent<br/>(L4 — Agent)
  participant HA as ⎈ HelmAgent<br/>(L4 — Agent)
  participant SS as 🛡️ SecurityScanner<br/>(L4 — Agent)
  participant CE as 💰 CostEstimator<br/>(L4 — Agent)
  participant RB as 📖 RunbookAgent<br/>(L4 — Agent)
  participant GW as 🧠 LiteLLM Proxy<br/>(L5 — AI Gateway)
  participant LLM as 🔮 Ollama / vLLM<br/>(L6 — Self-Hosted AI)
  participant MCP as 🔌 MCP Servers<br/>(L7 — Tool Execution)
  participant DB as 💾 pgvector + MinIO<br/>(L8 — Data Storage)

  CLI->>TRF: forgeflow deploy --path ./acme-flask-app --cloud gcp --env production
  Note over CLI: Click parses args<br/>Rich shows spinner<br/>JWT attached

  TRF->>TRF: TLS termination (Let's Encrypt)
  TRF->>TRF: Coraza WAF + CrowdSec IP check
  TRF->>MC: Keycloak OIDC verified → route to k3s
  Note over TRF: RBAC: user has deploy:production role

  MC->>MC: Parse deployment-intent.yaml
  MC->>MC: Build agent DAG (7 stages)
  Note over MC: Pipeline: scan → docker → terraform<br/>→ helm → security → cost → runbook

  MC->>RAG: Fetch context for "Flask + GCP + prod"
  RAG->>MCP: embedding-mcp → TEI encodes query
  MCP->>DB: pgvector cosine search (top-5)
  DB-->>RAG: Past Dockerfiles, TF modules, Helm values
  Note over RAG: 5 similar past deploys found<br/>(Python+GKE apps)

  MC->>PS: NATS: scan ./acme-flask-app
  PS->>MCP: filesystem-mcp reads project
  MCP-->>PS: Python 3.11, Flask, requirements.txt
  PS->>GW: Classify stack (LiteLLM)
  GW->>LLM: Ollama / Llama 3.1 70B
  LLM-->>PS: "Flask REST API, WSGI, PostgreSQL client"
  PS-->>MC: NATS ✅ scan complete

  MC->>DA: NATS: generate Dockerfile
  DA->>GW: Generate multi-stage Dockerfile (+ RAG context)
  GW->>LLM: Ollama / Llama 3.1 70B
  LLM-->>DA: Optimized Dockerfile
  DA->>MCP: docker-mcp → Buildah build
  DA->>MCP: docker-mcp → Harbor push + Trivy scan
  MCP-->>DA: Image pushed, 0 critical CVEs
  DA-->>MC: NATS ✅ docker complete

  MC->>TA: NATS: generate IaC
  TA->>GW: Generate OpenTofu modules (+ RAG context)
  GW->>LLM: Ollama / Llama 3.1 70B
  LLM-->>TA: VPC + k3s nodes + PostgreSQL + LB
  TA->>MCP: terraform-mcp → tofu init → tofu plan
  MCP->>DB: State stored in MinIO (S3 backend)
  TA-->>MC: NATS ✅ terraform complete

  MC->>HA: NATS: generate Helm chart
  HA->>GW: Generate K8s manifests (+ RAG context)
  GW->>LLM: vLLM / Mistral Large
  LLM-->>HA: Helm chart (deploy, svc, ingress, HPA)
  HA->>MCP: helm-mcp → lint + template
  MCP->>DB: Chart stored in MinIO
  HA-->>MC: NATS ✅ helm complete

  MC->>SS: NATS: scan all artifacts
  SS->>MCP: Trivy (container CVEs) + Checkov (IaC)
  MCP-->>SS: 0 critical, 2 medium IaC findings
  SS->>GW: LLM triage findings
  GW->>LLM: Ollama / Llama 3.1 70B
  LLM-->>SS: "2 medium accepted — internal service"
  SS-->>MC: NATS ✅ security passed

  MC->>CE: NATS: estimate costs
  CE->>MCP: Infracost OSS → parse TF plan
  MCP-->>CE: Compute: $127/mo, Storage: $23/mo
  CE->>GW: LLM budget analysis
  GW->>LLM: Ollama / Llama 3.1 70B
  LLM-->>CE: "Total: $150/mo — within budget"
  CE->>DB: ClickHouse: log cost estimate
  CE-->>MC: NATS ✅ cost complete

  MC->>MCP: Execute deploy actions
  MCP->>MCP: terraform-mcp: tofu apply
  MCP->>MCP: docker-mcp: push to Harbor
  MCP->>MCP: helm-mcp: helm upgrade --install
  MCP->>MCP: git-mcp: commit to Gitea → ArgoCD syncs
  Note over MCP: k3s deploys pods<br/>Cilium configures network

  MC->>DB: Persist all artifacts
  Note over DB: MinIO: Dockerfile, Helm, TF plan<br/>pgvector: embed for future RAG<br/>ClickHouse: audit log<br/>Vault: rotate credentials

  MC->>RB: NATS: generate runbook
  RB->>GW: Generate ops documentation
  GW->>LLM: vLLM / Mistral Large
  LLM-->>RB: Rollback, scaling, incident response
  RB->>MCP: git-mcp → commit RUNBOOK.md to Gitea
  RB-->>MC: NATS ✅ runbook complete

  MC->>GW: Generate deploy summary report
  GW->>LLM: vLLM / Mistral Large (formatting)
  LLM-->>MC: Narrative summary of all agent outputs
  Note over GW: Total: 6 LLM calls, 14,230 tokens<br/>$0.00 (self-hosted), 47s wall time

  MC->>TRF: Structured response via Traefik
  TRF->>CLI: Deploy result payload
  Note over CLI: Rich renders dashboard:<br/>Dockerfile ✅ | Terraform ✅ | Helm ✅<br/>Security ✅ | Cost $150/mo | Runbook ✅<br/>Links: Gitea, Harbor, Grafana, ArgoCD
